# Copy to .env.local and fill in from Supabase → Project Settings → API.
# Without these, comment mode falls back to storing comments in one browser only.
# Full instructions: src/comments/SETUP.md
#
# Use the key labelled `anon` / `public`. Never the `service_role` one — it
# bypasses row-level security and would be readable by anyone who opened devtools.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
